معماری نهایی امنیت:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Layer 1: IP Access Control (whitelist/blacklist)       │
│  Layer 2: Geo Blocking (country/city/ASN)               │
│  Layer 3: VPN/Proxy/Tor Detection                       │
│  Layer 4: Bot Detection (fingerprint + behavior)        │
│  Layer 5: Threat Intel (AbuseIPDB + Spamhaus)           │ ← جدید
│  Layer 6: Rate Limiting (global + per-route)            │
│  Layer 7: Brute-force Protection (lockout + ban)        │
│  Layer 8: Auth (Password + OAuth + 2FA)                 │
│  Layer 9: Security Headers (Helmet + CSP)               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```
